.TH UPC\-CARTRIDGECTL 1 "2026-11-05" "unheaded ad26fe56" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
upc\-cartridgectl \- Register, sign, load and swap UPC cartridges on the pinned cartridge interpreter.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B upc\-cartridgectl
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
COMMAND [ARG]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register, sign, load and swap UPC cartridges on the pinned cartridge interpreter.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B up | down | list | stats
pin or unpin the interpreter; list slots; print counters
.TP
.B sign \-\-key SEED [\-\-ttl D] FILE.cart
seal a cartridge with ML\-DSA\-65
.TP
.B register NAME FILE.cart
add a cartridge to the registry
.TP
.B load NAME \-\-slot N | unload \-\-slot N
load or unload a slot
.TP
.B swap NAME \-\-from A \-\-to B
swap a running cartridge between slots
.TP
.B bench [\-\-repeat N] [\-\-dport P] | pump [\-\-max N]
measure; drain events
.TP
.B serve [\-\-metrics\-addr ADDR] [\-\-xdp\-iface IF]
serve metrics
.TP
.B record \-\-out FILE [\-\-every N] [\-\-duration D]
record a trace
.TP
.B replay FILE \-\-slot N [\-\-image F] [\-\-run K] [\-\-to N] [\-\-watch X]
replay a trace
.TP
.B weights publish | weights fetch
publish or fetch sealed weights over Wotan (see weights \-\-help)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-allow\-untrusted\-obj
up: load an object a non\-root user could have written, as the default build\-tree \-obj is (development only)
.TP
.B \-\-cart \fISTRING\fR
the cart CLI (validator) (default crates/upc\-cartridge/target/release/cart)
.TP
.B \-\-events\-group \fISTRING\fR
up: make the CART_EVENTS pin readable by this group (cmd/anomaly's bridge); other pins stay root 0600
.TP
.B \-\-lab
accept UNSIGNED cartridges (lab only; marked lab="1")
.TP
.B \-\-obj \fISTRING\fR
cartridge\-ebpf object (for up) (default ebpf/target/bpfel\-unknown\-none/release/cartridge\-ebpf)
.TP
.B \-\-pin\-dir \fISTRING\fR
bpffs directory of the pinned interpreter (default /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded/cart)
.TP
.B \-\-pubkey \fISTRING\fR
pinned ML\-DSA\-65 public key that cartridge seals must verify against
.TP
.B \-\-registry\-dir \fISTRING\fR
file\-backed registry: records + content\-addressed images (0700) (default /var/lib/unheaded/cartridges)
.TP
.B \-\-sophia \fISTRING\fR
Sophia base URL: keep records in Sophia (namespace cartridge; x\-cartridge records still read); SOPHIA_TOKEN = bearer token
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
